Bundled Fonts

This repository includes font files in spur/public/fonts/ for the purpose of allowing the application to operate without access to external font/CDN services.

These font files are not covered by this repository's MIT License. They remain subject to their respective upstream licenses:

Figtree — SIL Open Font License 1.1
Fraunces — SIL Open Font License 1.1
IBM Plex Mono — SIL Open Font License 1.1

The font files are redistributed with this software in accordance with the terms of the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The corresponding font license and attribution information is provided in spur/public/fonts/LICENSE.

The inclusion of these fonts does not grant any additional rights to the application code beyond those provided by the MIT License, nor does it change the license applicable to the fonts themselves.

